def komira_aws_tiny_query_host(region: String) raises -> String:
    """`tinyquery.<region>.amazonaws.com`.

        ⚠ REGIONAL. An empty region here would sign against a host with a
        doubled dot and fail as DNS — an error that says nothing about the
        composition that left the region unset. So it is refused by name."""
